# Stage 10 / Phase 1 — bidirectionality verification log (ticket #51)

Each distinct NEW production behavior is verified bidirectionally: the exact
test command + its PASS with the production code present, then the revert/break
that removes the behavior, the genuine vitest FAIL naming the new test(s), and
the restore + green re-run. This proves the tests actually exercise the new
code — a test that passes both with and without the behavior is vacuous.

All commands run from the worktree root
(/home/subzerodev/workspace/satisfactory-foundry/.worktrees/canvas-p1).

